## Phase 3: Security & Deployment
Modernizing the deployment means moving away from "bare metal" scripts to a **multi-stage Docker build**. This keeps the final production image small and secure by excluding development dependencies and source code.

### Multi-stage Dockerfile

```dockerfile
# Stage 1: Build
FROM node:22-alpine AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY . .
RUN npm run build

# Stage 2: Production
FROM node:22-alpine
WORKDIR /app
ENV NODE_ENV=production
COPY --from=builder /app/dist ./dist
COPY --from=builder /app/package*.json ./
RUN npm ci --omit=dev
USER node
CMD ["node", "dist/server.js"]
```

